---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<PageLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles affiliate links and ads.`} updated="2026-11-04">
  <p><strong>Right now, {SITE.name} has no affiliate links and no paid placements.</strong></p>

  <p>In the future, some posts may include affiliate links. That means if you click a link and buy something, we may earn a small commission, at no extra cost to you. If a post contains affiliate links, it will say so clearly near the top of that post, not just here.</p>

  <h2>Our rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>We only recommend things where a recommendation actually helps the reader.</li>
    <li>Affiliate relationships never change our explanations, facts or conclusions.</li>
    <li>Nobody pays to be featured, and we don't accept paid reviews.</li>
    <li>If a post includes a sponsored item or a free product, we'll label it.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>This disclosure follows the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's guidance on endorsements. Questions? Use our contact page.</p>
</PageLayout>
